ra carregamento de carro elétrico, acompanhando as tendências de mobilidade sustentável.\n\nUma residência que reúne requinte, conforto e infraestrutura completa, pronta para proporcionar uma experiência única de morar bem. \n\nAgende sua visita e conheça de perto todos os detalhes deste imóvel exclusivo.\n\n*Os valores anunciados podem sofrer alterações sem aviso prévio.\n  \nObs: Casa em processo de averbação.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4fbeb74f-ecad-4837-bb56-e985fafa5481.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f66fcaf8-bc7a-4fc4-a072-e733c003b40e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7bc41c3b-42f0-40b1-86ea-7f83df243140.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8f49071a-147a-4ee0-a4b4-62caa047b3ce.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e1ba99ad-b9f4-426e-9c01-bb39dc432da4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e8fa341e-6b49-439c-a39a-8c6c9f999333.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cf7d5c94-296c-41b3-9563-2a7104704eb2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/36c4ae7d-0d46-40f1-be0e-d7974cd70205.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e3f53cd0-707f-4aba-a45a-58838e17c1da.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1f49d0e1-8e9d-47c8-951f-0d79f5f4899e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a305241d0a273efa26ae2f2/pilar-h